    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16f3df76fbff4e9a7f9f1a33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "采珠陪微光飞驹一起玩扮演英雄的游戏。\n但与英雄节目不同的是，\n竞赛无法确定最后将由谁获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3a9921dabc3faaef45b2b54b11e548b00593dc48da468ed746bdadd1846dbd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1042/storytimeline_501042207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5159fb350e8fc67cb0a0e48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我想替国外远征多保留一点时间。\n目前的计划是比赛结束后，从这里直接出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "927a58b75f0acf0eff4769a556bf8db341ab44a300bbf546ebbbc907247a9396",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1042/storytimeline_501042207.json",
      "json_path": [
