      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──“安田纪念”。\n这场比赛的距离为1600米，\n是采珠勉强能跑出最佳表现的距离。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a656c24d48484bb8c19acc964593ac178817dae90f1c7fbc34d6f3c910b3d3b0",
