      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这场出乎意料的坏天气，\n似乎能成为明白两人潜力的最佳测试。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e10f235bc217091905e655a6388726cad3e5ef5f7300b5fd9da3a7c268a506d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
